abstract: "Three open CSV datasets modeling legislated 2025/26-2029/30 UK EV Benefit-in-Kind tax increases across 15 electric cars, 10,000-mile EV vs petrol running costs including £200 VED, and Octopus Agile half-hourly regional spreads across all 14 Great Britain DNO zones."
